        rule: { ru: 'Вопрос в прошедшем: What did you + глагол? Did — это помощник для вопросов о прошлом.', uk: 'Запитання в минулому: What did you + дієслово? Did — це помічник для запитань про минуле.', es: 'Pregunta en pasado: What did you + verbo? Did es el auxiliar para preguntas en pasado.' , 'pt-BR': 'Pergunta no pretérito: What did you + verbo? Did é o auxiliar para perguntas no pretérito.', vi: 'Câu hỏi ở thì quá khứ: What did you + động từ? Did là trợ động từ cho câu hỏi ở thì quá khứ.', id: 'Pertanyaan dalam bentuk lampau: What did you + kata kerja? Did adalah kata bantu untuk pertanyaan dalam bentuk lampau.', tr: 'Geçmiş zamanda soru: What did you + fiil? Did geçmiş zamandaki sorular için yardımcıdır.', pl: 'Pytanie w czasie przeszłym: What did you + czasownik? Did jest środkiem pomocniczym w przypadku pytań w czasie przeszłym.'},
        why: { ru: 'Без did вопрос звучит неправильно. Did берёт на себя прошедшее время.', uk: 'Без did запитання звучить неправильно. Did бере на себе минулий час.', es: 'Sin did la pregunta suena incorrecta. Did lleva la marca de pasado.' , 'pt-BR': 'Sem did a pergunta parece incorreta. Did carrega a marca anterior.', vi: 'Nếu không có did thì câu hỏi có vẻ sai. Did mang dấu ấn quá khứ.', id: 'Tanpa did pertanyaannya terdengar salah. Did memiliki tanda lampau.', tr: 'did olmadan soru yanlış geliyor. Did geçmiş işaretini taşıyor.', pl: 'Bez did pytanie brzmi niepoprawnie. Did nosi znak przeszłości.'},
        commonMistake: { ru: 'Не говори «What you read?» — нужен did: «What did you read?».', uk: 'Не кажи «What you read?» — потрібен did: «What did you read?».', es: 'No digas «What you read?» — necesitas did: «What did you read?».' , 'pt-BR': 'Não diga "What you read?" - você precisa de did: “What did you read?”', vi: 'Đừng nói "What you read?" — bạn cần did: “What did you read?”', id: 'Jangan ucapkan "What you read?" — Anda memerlukan did: “What did you read?”', tr: '"What you read?" deme. — did\'ye ihtiyacınız var: “What did you read?”', pl: 'Nie mów „What you read?” — potrzebujesz did: „What did you read?”'},
